  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\nAll notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.\n\n## [1.2.0] - 2026-05-26\n\n### 🚀 Features\n\n- *(Controls)* Add CardGroupBoxTheme and CascadeGroupBoxTheme\n- *(Controls)* TimePicker theme polish needed WIP\n- *(Control)* PaginationControl phase 1\n- *(Controls)* Add quick jumper to pagination control phase 2\n- *(Controls)* Totally finish all phases about PaginationControl\n- *(DatePicker)* Add datepicker\n- *(Calender)* Add calendar date picker\n\n### 💼 Other\n\n- *(format)* Format\n\n### 🚜 Refactor\n\n- *(Controls)* Adjust colors\n- *(Controls)* Make time picker production ready\n\n### ⚙️ Miscellaneous Tasks\n\n- Fix a runtime noise\n- Move props to .props\n- *(DateTimePicker)* Adjust visual\n\n<!-- generated by git-cliff -->",
